                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 275.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Abbott to Sir
                            H. Drummond Wolff.</hi></head>
                <p>Just received telegram from Canon Maclean, Oroomiah, that Kurds around Kochannes
                    in Turkey have formed a plan to massacre Christians at Tiary and Tehoman. He
                    requests me to take immediate steps for their protection. Rev. Browne, one of
                    our clergy, is at Kochannes.</p>
            </div>
